[block'ORD-0045-burn-fences'
  [ref'EMS']
  [ctx'the defect measured, the variants and the answers of the Regent','.guidelines/.orders/INTAKE-BURN-FENCES.md, sections 1 to 5']
  [tgt'the burn of a raw fence and of a logic block rereads to what the source said, in the Rust only: the open fence carrying what it holds']
  [ins'burn a raw fence as the open fence carrying its body verbatim, and every logic block, named or not, as the open fence carrying its rules']
  [ins'name the nine hgml differences in rust/testkit/known, undone where an oracle test holds the Rust burn to the JS one']
  [ins'hold in the Rust that a fence and a block reread to the same XML, and that every declared burn rereads with no fix its source lacks, none known']
  [cnst'burn.js keeps the defect until the JS leaves, and H-16 keeps OC-12 and R-04 in its KNOWN while the JS burns']
